  "question": {
    "text": "Let the product of $\\omega_1=(8+i) \\sin \\theta+(7+4 i) \\cos \\theta$ and $\\omega_2=(1+8 i) \\sin \\theta+(4+7 i) \\cos \\theta$ be $\\alpha+i \\beta$, $\\mathrm{i}=\\sqrt{-1}$. Let p and q be the maximum and the minimum values of $\\alpha+\\beta$ respectively.",
